 * 5. Validate that the system returns an authorization/permission error for the update attempt.
 *
 * Note: This test assumes per-API-call authentication context ("connection") reflects the acting member. You must ensure that API requests to create a reaction are made as the owner, and the update call is made as a different member (memberOther). Authentication/session switching should be handled by the test infra, if not shown inline here.
 */
export async function test_api_discussionBoard_test_update_comment_reaction_unauthorized(
