 * 4. Delete (soft-delete) the comment thread as the creator.
 * 5. (Cannot implement) Attempt to retrieve thread as regular member (should be hidden).
 * 6. (Cannot implement) Attempt to retrieve as admin/audit filter (should be visible).
 * 7. Additional: Try to delete again (should be idempotent or already deleted).
 *
 * Due to API limitations (no GET/list endpoints for threads), this test covers only the creation and deletion flow.
